        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214297/Aboriginal-artist-recreating-oldest-living-weaving-practice-with-glass",
        "content_text": "Aboriginal artist recreating oldest living weaving practice with glass.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-07-11/act-aboriginal-woman-glass-artist-traditional-weaving-technique/106902124\">Lower Southern Arrernte woman Jenni Kemarre Martiniello creates glass artworks by combining a centuries-old Italian glassmaking technique with millennia-old Indigenous weaving practices.</a>",
