        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214295/The-solace-of-eternity",
        "content_text": "\"<a href=\"https://a.co/d/0eVlv94j\">Last and First Men</a>\" is not progressive. Civilizations rise and fall, the tide of progress advances and retreats, variants upon the theme of humanity strike up and diminish &#8212; what endures of humanity is not spirit in the Christian sense so much as, in the philosophy of the Fifth Men, \"<a href=\"https://thereader.mitpress.mit.edu/the-man-who-saw-humanity-from-two-billion-years-away/\">a work of tragic art.</a>\"<br/><br/><a href=\"https://sf-encyclopedia.com/entry/stapledon_olaf\">Olaf Stapledon</a> <a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/188187/You-who-are-members-of-the-First-Human-Species\">previ</a><a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/47031/Olaf-Stapledon-The-Star-Maker\">ously</a>",
