        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-releases-new-magic-keyboards-with-one-notable-change/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/magic-keyboard-new-2026.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Apple launched its latest <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-announces-new-mac-mini-heres-everything-new/\">Mac mini</a> and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-unveils-next-generation-mac-studio-with-m5-max-and-m5-ultra/\">Mac Studio</a> models, and alongside the release, minor updates have been made to the company’s various Magic Keyboard accessories.</p>",
