        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/m6-mac-mini-vs-m4-mac-mini-here-are-all-the-new-features/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/mac-mini-m6-m5-pro-vs-m4.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-announces-new-mac-mini-heres-everything-new/\">launched a new Mac mini</a>, available in M6 and M5 Pro configurations. Here’s everything new compared to the M4 and M4 Pro Mac mini models.</p>",
