        "title": "iOS 27 adds three new iPhone features I’ve been really loving",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/24/ios-27-adds-three-new-iphone-features-ive-been-really-loving/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/ios-27-iphone-side-angle-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 is packed with new features across <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/10/heres-everything-new-for-messages-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1056016\">Messages</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/10/heres-everything-new-for-apple-notes-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1056067\">Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/08/heres-everything-new-for-apple-wallet-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055623\">Apple Wallet</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/09/heres-everything-new-for-carplay-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055739\">CarPlay</a>, and more. Here are three of my favorite new iOS 27 features so far.</p>",
