        "title": "The Great Floating Homes of Los Angeles",
        "url": "https://www.newyorker.com/news/dispatch/the-great-floating-homes-of-los-angeles",
        "content_text": "In the city’s burnt neighborhoods, rebuilding is brutally expensive. Now residents have turned to a lost art: moving entire houses to their vacant lots.",
        "type": "Long Reads",
        "source": "The New Yorker"
