        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-releases-new-polishing-cloth-for-9/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2021/10/Apple-Polishing-Cloth.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not to be overshadowed by the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-announces-new-mac-mini-heres-everything-new/\">new Mac mini</a> and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/apple-unveils-next-generation-mac-studio-with-m5-max-and-m5-ultra/\">Mac Studio</a>, Apple today has also released an updated version of its Polishing Cloth. In an age of everything getting more expensive, the new Polishing Cloth is <a href=\"https://apple.sjv.io/X45RDb\">cheaper than before at $9</a> (down from $19). It’s also available on Amazon</p>",
